Commands to follow:

1) Now create single node k8s cluster :
->  kind create cluster --name=single-node-demo
2) Check if cluster created : (Kind is the tool that created and manages this cluster):
-> kind get clusters
3) Delete a cluster :
-> kind delete cluster --name single-node-demo
